 -open-mic-night-2026-10-14\n\nPoetry + Prose Open Mic Night takes the sec
 ond Wednesday of every month at 7pm at Black Bird Bookstore + Cafe in San
  Francisco. Poets\, writers\, scribblers and dreamers are invited to take
  the stand\, and first timers are welcome. The night is for poetry and pr
 ose\; stand-up comedy and music are not part of it. Signups start at 6:30
 pm\, and local poet Laura Booth hosts. Entry is free.
